{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "dd7ee6f8-2149-4c97-9a0e-71a05938de2c",
    "name": "periferiait-logic-service",
    "description": "Colección del microservicio de publicaciones y likes (periferiait-logic-service, puerto 8082).\n\nRequiere un JWT válido. Ejecuta primero 'Login' en la colección Auth Service: guarda el token en la variable GLOBAL `authToken` que estas requests reutilizan.\n\nFlujo sugerido:\n1. List Posts   -> guarda el id del primer post en `postId`.\n2. Create Post  -> guarda el id del nuevo post en `postId`.\n3. Toggle Like  -> da/quita like a `postId` (difunde el nuevo total por WebSocket /topic/posts.likes).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "36696823"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "posts",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "/",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const posts = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (Array.isArray(posts) && posts.length > 0) {",
                  "  pm.globals.set('postId', posts[0].id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('postId', posts[0].id);",
                  "  console.log('postId =', posts[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{logicBaseUrl}}/posts",
              "host": [
                "{{logicBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "posts"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista todas las publicaciones con su total de likes (requiere Bearer token)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "/",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "const post = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (post.id) {",
                  "  pm.globals.set('postId', post.id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('postId', post.id);",
                  "  console.log('Nuevo postId =', post.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"Publicación de prueba desde Postman 🚀\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{logicBaseUrl}}/posts",
              "host": [
                "{{logicBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "posts"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crea una publicación. El autor se toma del JWT y la fecha la asigna la BD por defecto."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "likes",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve likeCount', function () { pm.expect(res.likeCount).to.be.a('number'); });",
                  "console.log('Total de likes =', res.likeCount);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{logicBaseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}/likes",
              "host": [
                "{{logicBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "posts",
                "{{postId}}",
                "likes"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Da o quita like a la publicación `postId` y devuelve el total actualizado (procedure sp_toggle_like). El nuevo total se difunde por WebSocket."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{logicBaseUrl}}/actuator/health",
          "host": [
            "{{logicBaseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "actuator",
            "health"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Estado del servicio (observabilidad)."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "logicBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8082"
    },
    {
      "key": "authToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "postId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ]
}